      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAGARTEN (3) finished 2.5 lengths away in fifth last time out over 1300m at Darwin two-and-a-half weeks ago. Steps up in journey today which should suit him much better. Looks to have found a winnable race today. ALOTTA DANE (4) scored on dirt over 1780m at Broome two starts ago then couldn't find the top-three on the same surface last time out over 2070m at Broome. On the improve and is in the mix again back on turf. LEVERAGED BUYOUT (1) drifted well back and failed to finish it off last start when tenth over 2050m at Darwin. Finds a nice race and can take this out. OSCAR WINNER (5) is on a quick back-up after finishing eighth in better company seven days ago over 1615m at Broome. Should be competitive in this suitable race. BON'S YOUR BACK (2) won't be far away.",
